{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日\n真夏と花火大会行ってきました～(*゜▽゜)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"念願の！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年から\n一緒に行こうって言ってたから\n本当にやっとなの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/08/06/9088961/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/08/06/9088961/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ近かった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キュウリとじゃがバター食べたよ～\nお祭りで食べるのって\n数倍美味しく感じる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帰りに真夏が誕プレくれた(*°-°*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メールで写メ送ったけど\n生誕祭で言ってた\n美味しいクッキーも作ってきてくれたの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/08/06/9088961/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"安定のうまぺろ(๑>؂<๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、\nそうなんです\n今日が中田の誕生日です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかもはたちの誕生日"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小さい頃、\n忘れ物が多かったり\n物を壊したり\n怒られて反省しても"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうしても怒られる事をやってしまって\n悩んでたけど\nママもパパも忘れ物とか全然しないし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はたちになったら完璧な大人になれる\nのかと思ってた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今は子供だからしょうがないのか\nとか考えてた子供でした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"16歳、17歳、18歳、19歳と\n歳を重ねてくうちに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分が想像してた大人になれそうにない事に気づいて\nここ最近、失望してたんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"逆に\nこれからの目標ができました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"理想の良い大人になれるように\n頑張ろうと思います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/08/06/9088961/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"20歳の中田もよろしくお願いします○┓"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/08/06/9088961/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}